classDiagram
    class Node {
        +NodeId id
        +StructureId structure
        +ParamSchema params
        +Composition composition
        +Vec~ChannelRef~ bindings
        +signature() Hash256
    }
    class StructureRegistry {
        +register(StructureMeta, Factory)
        +resolve(StructureId, SolvedParams) Box~dyn MathStructure~
    }
    class MathStructure {
        <<trait>>
        +meta() StructureMeta
        +apply(Payload, EvalCtx) Payload
        +invert(Payload, EvalCtx) Payload
        +sample(SampleIndex, EvalCtx) Payload
    }
    class StructureMeta {
        +KernelKind kernel
        +DualityPair duality
        +LatticePlan lattice
    }
    class EvalCtx {
        +u64 global_seed
        +NodeId node_id
        +u64 frame
        +LatticeCtx lattice
    }
    class SampleIndex {
        +u64 frame
        +u32 sample
        +u16 dimension
        +u64 node_id
    }
    class PropertyChannel {
        +eval(t) SolvedParams
    }
    Node --> PropertyChannel : 参数绑定（A2）
    Node --> StructureRegistry : 构建期登记
    StructureRegistry o-- MathStructure : 特解实例按签名复用
    MathStructure --> StructureMeta : 三问元数据
    MathStructure --> EvalCtx : 求值上下文
    EvalCtx --> SampleIndex : hash 纯函数派生
    note for MathStructure "三操作=接口全集；能力面由 meta 显式声明"
